
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.SetScriptState(ScriptName: string, Running: boolean)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llSetScriptState(string ScriptName, integer Running);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Set the running state of the script <b>name</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>ScriptName / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/name" target="_blank">name</a></td>
          <td>a script in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the prim this script is in</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>boolean</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Running / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">running</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a>, if <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a>[[1]](#footnote_1) the script will be enabled, if <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a> the script will be disabled</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim_inventory</li>
        <li>script</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">148</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If <b>name</b> is missing from the prim's inventory or it is not a script then an error is shouted on <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/DEBUG_CHANNEL" target="_blank">DEBUG_CHANNEL</a>.</li>
    <li>Cannot be used to restart a script that has encountered a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Error" target="_blank">run-time error</a>.</li>
    <li>Cannot be used to start a script that has been added via <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGiveInventory" target="_blank">llGiveInventory</a>. Scripts sent via <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRemoteLoadScriptPin" target="_blank">llRemoteLoadScriptPin</a>, and which have the running state set FALSE by that command, may be started.</li>
    <li>The script appears to stop when its time slice ends, not sooner. If a script tries to stop itself then some LSL code following the llSetScriptState call may be executed before the script stops.</li>
    <li>If a script is paused by llSetScriptState and is then either re-rezzed, in a region during a restart, or moved into a different region, the script's memory is reset.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`--Stops the Script, at some non-deterministic time later, until invoked with TRUE, in another script
ll.SetScriptState(ll.GetScriptName(), false)
-- Stall until end of time slice
ll.Sleep(0.1)`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`//Stops the Script, at some non-deterministic time later, until invoked with TRUE, in another script
llSetScriptState(llGetScriptName(),FALSE);
// Stall until end of time slice
llSleep(0.1);`} lang="lsl" /></div>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`--Starts Another Script
ll.SetScriptState("somescript", true)`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`//Starts Another Script
llSetScriptState("somescript",TRUE);`} lang="lsl" /></div>
